  "description": "Lightweight, dependency-free Hangul (Korean) composer for real-time syllable assembly.\n      Converts Dubeolsik (두벌식) Latin keystrokes into Unicode syllable blocks (U+AC00–U+D7A3)\n      on the fly. Suitable for game engines, custom text input widgets, or any environment\n      where OS IME is unavailable.",
